WEBVTT

00:34:27.292 --> 00:34:31.893
And I was surprised at first
that relationships came lower

00:34:31.917 --> 00:34:34.768
because clearly helping others
in such a relational dynamic.

00:34:34.792 --> 00:34:38.476
And I'm suddenly realizing that helping
has been my solution to this problem.

00:34:38.500 --> 00:34:41.893
It's to say, OK, if my stance
on relationships is I want to be helpful,

00:34:41.917 --> 00:34:44.934
then I can still know
whether my goal has been achieved or not,

00:34:44.958 --> 00:34:48.309
whereas if the goal is just to build
the relationship or to earn trust,

00:34:48.333 --> 00:34:50.476
it's never clear
whether I've made progress.

00:34:50.500 --> 00:34:52.809
And I don't know whether
I'm using my time well.

00:34:52.833 --> 00:34:54.893
So what would you suggest doing with that?

00:34:54.917 --> 00:34:56.309
EP: I think when you have --

00:34:56.333 --> 00:34:58.934
AG: I'm trying to get
a solution here, I really am.

00:34:58.958 --> 00:35:01.809
EP: No, but look, helping
is a lot of things, right?